{"title":"철냄비 짱! [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=cad7h6/dJMcaaRX2rg/DLHp1Cv1CE7E8oRcXt42sK&filename=th3","synopsis":"중화요리의 명가 '고반쵸반점'에 갑자기 나타난 남자, 아키야마 짱.\n그는 바로 중화요리 패왕의 손자였다.\n'요리는 승부다'라며 고집을 부리는 짱은 고반쵸반점에 들어와,\n오너의 손녀인 천재 소녀 고반쵸 키리코나\n심술궂은 요리평론가 오타니 니치도의 자객과 요리 승부를 펼친다.\n그리고 짱을 싫어하는 오타니의 제안으로,\n젊은 요리사들이 대결하는 '제1회 전국 중화요리 선수권 대회'가 개최된다.\n짱의 승부는 지금, 시작된다!\n\nTETSUNABE NO JAN\n©Shinji Saijo 2005\nFirst published in Japan in 2005 by KADOKAWA CORPORATION, Tokyo.\nKorean translation rights arranged with KADOKAWA CORPORATION, Tokyo.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":243,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":190,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":259,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":174,"change":{"type":"up","amount":85}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":243,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":235,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":265,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":183,"change":{"type":"up","amount":82}},{"date":"2026-09-22","rank":193,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-23","rank":196,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-09-24","rank":202,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-09-25","rank":225,"change":{"type":"down","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-09-27","rank":274,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-28","rank":267,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-09-29","rank":85,"change":{"type":"up","amount":182}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":293,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":276,"change":{"type":"up","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":254,"change":{"type":"up","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":262,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":239,"change":{"type":"up","